# Peticiones de ejemplo para probar la API a mano.
# Visual Studio 2022 (17.8+) y JetBrains Rider las ejecutan de forma nativa: clic en "Send request" / "Enviar solicitud".
# En VS Code: instalar la extensión "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) y usar "Send Request".
# Requiere la API corriendo:  dotnet run --project src/Leaderboard.Api   (o Docker; ver EJECUTAR.md)

@base = http://localhost:8080
# Keys de Development (dotnet run). Con Docker usar demo-writer-key / demo-reader-key.
@writerKey = dev-ingestor-key
@readerKey = dev-reader-key

### 1. Salud (pública)
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### 2. Registrar una puntuación (201 Created)
# {{$datetime iso8601}} = fecha actual en UTC (Visual Studio 2022 y REST Client). En Rider usar {{$isoTimestamp}}.
POST {{base}}/score
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{writerKey}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-alice-1

{ "user_id": "alice", "score": 50, "timestamp": "{{$datetime iso8601}}" }

### 3. Reintentar la MISMA petición (200 duplicate: no vuelve a sumar)
POST {{base}}/score
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{writerKey}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-alice-1

{ "user_id": "alice", "score": 50, "timestamp": "{{$datetime iso8601}}" }

### 4. Otra puntuación para otro usuario
POST {{base}}/score
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{writerKey}}

{ "user_id": "bob", "score": 80, "timestamp": "{{$datetime iso8601}}" }

### 5. Top N (lectura)
GET {{base}}/leaderboard?top=10
X-Api-Key: {{readerKey}}

### 6. Score de un usuario
GET {{base}}/user/alice/score
X-Api-Key: {{readerKey}}

### 7. Usuario inexistente (404)
GET {{base}}/user/nadie/score
X-Api-Key: {{readerKey}}

### 8. Payload inválido (400 con todos los errores)
POST {{base}}/score
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{writerKey}}

{ "user_id": "bad id", "score": -1, "timestamp": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z" }

### 9. Sin API key (401)
GET {{base}}/leaderboard

### 10. Key de solo lectura intentando escribir (403)
POST {{base}}/score
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{readerKey}}

{ "user_id": "alice", "score": 1, "timestamp": "{{$datetime iso8601}}" }

### 11. Métricas Prometheus (pública)
GET {{base}}/metrics

### 12. Contrato OpenAPI (público)
GET {{base}}/openapi/v1.json
